704
00:43:31,200 --> 00:43:33,320
I pray that you'd help us to be doers of the word

705
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:35,120
and not hearers only.

706
00:43:35,120 --> 00:43:36,820
I pray, God, that you would help us

707
00:43:36,820 --> 00:43:40,360
to take the truth that we've learned.

708
00:43:40,360 --> 00:43:42,640
And Lord, maybe we need to evaluate

709
00:43:42,640 --> 00:43:44,080
maybe some things that we're hearing,

710
00:43:44,080 --> 00:43:45,440
some things that we're listening to.

711
00:43:45,440 --> 00:43:49,160
Maybe, Lord, some things that our children are hearing

712
00:43:49,160 --> 00:43:51,800
or listening to, reading, watching,

713
00:43:51,800 --> 00:43:53,440
whatever it might be.

714
00:43:53,440 --> 00:43:56,200
Lord, help us to take caution.

715
00:43:56,200 --> 00:43:57,880
Help us to take heed.

716
00:43:57,880 --> 00:43:59,480
I pray that in the moment of invitation

717
00:43:59,480 --> 00:44:00,400
that you'd have your will and way.

718
00:44:00,400 --> 00:44:02,000
Lord, work in hearts as only you can.

719
00:44:02,000 --> 00:44:03,160
For it's in Christ's name we pray.

720
00:44:03,160 --> 00:44:04,000
Would you stand with me?

721
00:44:04,000 --> 00:44:05,040
Heads are bowed, eyes are closed.

722
00:44:05,040 --> 00:44:07,240
We'll have an invitation this evening,

723
00:44:07,240 --> 00:44:08,280
give you an opportunity.

724
00:44:08,280 --> 00:44:09,280
If the Lord's spoken to you,

725
00:44:09,280 --> 00:44:10,920
you need to come this evening.

726
00:44:10,920 --> 00:44:13,120
The altar is open as Kimberly plays.

